(1984256, 271987, 28029, '<td valign="top">Hey you only used 17 kb which resulted in a very fuzzy image. You need to figure out how to maximize your file size after you re-size to 640. Its easy if you have Photoshop, but I am sure that you would be able to do it easily with other programs as well.<br/>You will not do well this time because of this. Don''t get discouraged.</td>', 'Hey you only used 17 kb which resulted in a very fuzzy image. You need to figure out how to maximize your file size after you re-size to 640. Its easy if you have Photoshop, but I am sure that you would be able to do it easily with other programs as well.You will not do well this time because of this. Don''t get discouraged.', '2005-12-28 19:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1984261, 272409, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is a gem in the midst of some pretty mediocre images.   I love the sharpness of the tiger contrasting with the softness of the rain.  Beautiful color and clarity.  :)</td>', 'This is a gem in the midst of some pretty mediocre images.   I love the sharpness of the tiger contrasting with the softness of the rain.  Beautiful color and clarity.  :)', '2005-12-28 19:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
