(1984300, 273019, 24511, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this very picture on the canal waters near Ottawa a month ago.  It was such a surprise at the time but now it looks much more common.  They are so much more funny live.  I enjoy the unusual pose.  Typical move from anyone trying to avoid being photographed.  I would have liked seing a head peeking at us.  A triangle formation would have been interesting.  A couple would have made a good pair but the four bird corner to corner design seems ordinairy.  Good luck</td>', 'I''ve seen this very picture on the canal waters near Ottawa a month ago.  It was such a surprise at the time but now it looks much more common.  They are so much more funny live.  I enjoy the unusual pose.  Typical move from anyone trying to avoid being photographed.  I would have liked seing a head peeking at us.  A triangle formation would have been interesting.  A couple would have made a good pair but the four bird corner to corner design seems ordinairy.  Good luck', '2005-12-28 20:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
