(1985722, 273193, 26633, '<td valign="top">There''s something strange going on here ;)<br/>If not for the tree I would have put this down to one of the loony Icelanders ... so instead I''ll just have to settle for giving it a 9. Great composition, enough of a sense of mystery to make me keep coming back to look at it.</td>', 'There''s something strange going on here ;)If not for the tree I would have put this down to one of the loony Icelanders ... so instead I''ll just have to settle for giving it a 9. Great composition, enough of a sense of mystery to make me keep coming back to look at it.', '2005-12-29 08:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
