(1986105, 272877, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think there''s a fair chance this is fotoman.  The model in the black looks faintly like the model in his last photo.  I''m guessing this one is going to give a run for the brown.  Nudity doesn''t always fly on this site and I haven''t yet seen a lesbian shot.  To put that all aside for a second, I''m not sure about the photo in general.  I don''t know if a "domino sugar cube ad" is supposed to invoke something for me to compare or not.  If it is, it''s too esoteric for me.  The picture has only average lighting and composition.  I''m afraid I''m not going to help keep you from the brown...2</td>', 'I think there''s a fair chance this is fotoman.  The model in the black looks faintly like the model in his last photo.  I''m guessing this one is going to give a run for the brown.  Nudity doesn''t always fly on this site and I haven''t yet seen a lesbian shot.  To put that all aside for a second, I''m not sure about the photo in general.  I don''t know if a "domino sugar cube ad" is supposed to invoke something for me to compare or not.  If it is, it''s too esoteric for me.  The picture has only average lighting and composition.  I''m afraid I''m not going to help keep you from the brown...2', '2005-12-29 12:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
