(1986534, 273200, 50034, '<td valign="top">Only eat the green ones!!!Must press on to be a world-class chef!  Some nicks &amp; cuts are to be expected along the way.  :)<br/>Visually believable, but logically far-fetched!  Obviously posed because the photo is too crisp &amp; clear, no camera shake that goes along with anxiety associated with the loss of an appendage, and no splatter marks on the lens.</td>', 'Only eat the green ones!!!Must press on to be a world-class chef!  Some nicks & cuts are to be expected along the way.  :)Visually believable, but logically far-fetched!  Obviously posed because the photo is too crisp & clear, no camera shake that goes along with anxiety associated with the loss of an appendage, and no splatter marks on the lens.', '2005-12-29 15:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
