(1986586, 272490, 50034, '<td valign="top">Been there!  Done that!  Tell Gramps to go easy on the turkey &amp; canndied yams!<br/>Concept SOLD!  Clear...beautiful reds...could have been more simplified, though.  Tree, toys, bricks needed to be strongly soft focus.  Less butt more child.  Re-frame.  Stand further away, take at least 70mm or 80mm zoom because "doggie-nose effect" is in play on the butt.  Unless that was intentional, then you hit the bulls-eye "so-to-speak."  ;)</td>', 'Been there!  Done that!  Tell Gramps to go easy on the turkey & canndied yams!Concept SOLD!  Clear...beautiful reds...could have been more simplified, though.  Tree, toys, bricks needed to be strongly soft focus.  Less butt more child.  Re-frame.  Stand further away, take at least 70mm or 80mm zoom because "doggie-nose effect" is in play on the butt.  Unless that was intentional, then you hit the bulls-eye "so-to-speak."  ;)', '2005-12-29 16:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
