(1988434, 273219, 34547, '<td valign="top">I''m going to guess this has been rotated but not because it looks like it was. Nice color and crisp lines. For perfection I''d like to see the background more consistent, but it is hardly a gripe. I like the simple boarder. Cool photo!</td>', 'I''m going to guess this has been rotated but not because it looks like it was. Nice color and crisp lines. For perfection I''d like to see the background more consistent, but it is hardly a gripe. I like the simple boarder. Cool photo!', '2005-12-30 12:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
