(1988571, 273240, 45194, '<td valign="top">Love the color and composition of this shot.  The subject matter isn''t as good as it could be or I would have rated it higher.  Great job though....stellar color!</td>', 'Love the color and composition of this shot.  The subject matter isn''t as good as it could be or I would have rated it higher.  Great job though....stellar color!', '2005-12-30 14:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
