(1988579, 273200, 47545, '<td valign="top">Funny photo, good choice of colors, good lighting... the "blood" looks a little fake though... perhaps more "blood" on the other side of the knife to give a feeling of a severed finger?</td>', 'Funny photo, good choice of colors, good lighting... the "blood" looks a little fake though... perhaps more "blood" on the other side of the knife to give a feeling of a severed finger?', '2005-12-30 14:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
