(1989914, 273193, 44490, '<td valign="top">I think that this is the most interesting entry for the challenge - has me wondering about the loss of the wings, angel in black vs. white, pondering the wings, and maybe how to get them back?  Great idea, execution, and composition.  Love it.</td>', 'I think that this is the most interesting entry for the challenge - has me wondering about the loss of the wings, angel in black vs. white, pondering the wings, and maybe how to get them back?  Great idea, execution, and composition.  Love it.', '2005-12-31 01:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1989931, 273162, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good composition and DOF so the sink is recognizable but not distracting.  Made me smile even though my teeth were rattling.  Striped toothpaste on the screen would be a nice and colorful touch.</td>', 'Good composition and DOF so the sink is recognizable but not distracting.  Made me smile even though my teeth were rattling.  Striped toothpaste on the screen would be a nice and colorful touch.', '2005-12-31 01:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
