(1991515, 273209, 41091, '<td valign="top">Haha this happens a lot at college ;), but I''m guessing this is a father/daughter or brother sister thing... hard to tell by the face being blocked.  As far as the pic, it has that brown overtone that you can fix in PS - levels command.. or right in camera by adjusting White Balance to the lightbulb icon.</td>', 'Haha this happens a lot at college ;), but I''m guessing this is a father/daughter or brother sister thing... hard to tell by the face being blocked.  As far as the pic, it has that brown overtone that you can fix in PS - levels command.. or right in camera by adjusting White Balance to the lightbulb icon.', '2005-12-31 23:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
