(1992554, 273193, 47020, '<td valign="top">I like this shot -- it has a certain je ne sais quoi that really captures my attention.  That said, it would elevate to "I _really_ like this shot", I think, if either the left side (i.e. the tree and about 1/3 of the space between the tree and the person) were cropped off, or, perhaps if she moved back about a step -- to about where that gap in the snow seems to be.  I''m giving it an 8, but it could easily be at least a 9, and possibly a 10, for me.</td>', 'I like this shot -- it has a certain je ne sais quoi that really captures my attention.  That said, it would elevate to "I _really_ like this shot", I think, if either the left side (i.e. the tree and about 1/3 of the space between the tree and the person) were cropped off, or, perhaps if she moved back about a step -- to about where that gap in the snow seems to be.  I''m giving it an 8, but it could easily be at least a 9, and possibly a 10, for me.', '2006-01-01 14:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
