(1993616, 272998, 41675, '<td valign="top">I must say I''m not sure how this fits into the challnege. Especially the juxtaposition of the Coca-Cola can. The photo is a bit grainy and blurry as well. Sorry.</td>', 'I must say I''m not sure how this fits into the challnege. Especially the juxtaposition of the Coca-Cola can. The photo is a bit grainy and blurry as well. Sorry.', '2006-01-01 23:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
