(1993710, 272655, 41675, '<td valign="top">Not a bad image, the "blood" looks more realistic than the blood in other photos I''ve seen. For me, the image doesn''t hold my interest as well as other entries...it needs...something, but unfortunately my untrained eye doesn''t know what.</td>', 'Not a bad image, the "blood" looks more realistic than the blood in other photos I''ve seen. For me, the image doesn''t hold my interest as well as other entries...it needs...something, but unfortunately my untrained eye doesn''t know what.', '2006-01-01 23:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
