(1997832, 272654, 12611, '<td valign="top">Well, giving you the benefit of meeting the challenge; The grainy quality does not work here when combined with the stop motion light blur and the black and white. Single in on an element; the grain, and make the shot clean and clear otherwise; or single in on the motion blur, and make the rest smooth and in focus. Just my thoughts.</td>', 'Well, giving you the benefit of meeting the challenge; The grainy quality does not work here when combined with the stop motion light blur and the black and white. Single in on an element; the grain, and make the shot clean and clear otherwise; or single in on the motion blur, and make the rest smooth and in focus. Just my thoughts.', '2006-01-03 08:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1997833, 273220, 28710, '<td valign="top">Great idea, great look on Buddha''s fingers. Too bad about the cut off leaves. I would guess that it would look better with just a little bit of leaf or the whole thing.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great idea, great look on Buddha''s fingers. Too bad about the cut off leaves. I would guess that it would look better with just a little bit of leaf or the whole thing. ', '2006-01-03 08:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
