(2002821, 273220, 28710, '<td valign="top">Are you sure this is a tangerine? When I worked at the health food store, we got a fruit in that looked like this called Buddha''s Fingers (in the catalogue) It has very little flesh inside, but you use the peel instead.<br/> <br/>Here in Taiwan, around this time of the year, you get these in stores for Chinese New Year time. <br/> <br/>And the HUMUNGOUS mandarin oranges, bigger than a child''s head... hmmm got me thinking about a shot...<br/> <br/>If this is a tangerine, that''s weird!</td>', 'Are you sure this is a tangerine? When I worked at the health food store, we got a fruit in that looked like this called Buddha''s Fingers (in the catalogue) It has very little flesh inside, but you use the peel instead. Here in Taiwan, around this time of the year, you get these in stores for Chinese New Year time.  And the HUMUNGOUS mandarin oranges, bigger than a child''s head... hmmm got me thinking about a shot... If this is a tangerine, that''s weird!', '2006-01-04 12:25:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2002831, 272191, 28710, '<td valign="top">After the challenge.<br/> <br/>Well, I liked it before and I still like it. Oddly, the thing that really makes me like it is the sharpness at the bottom of the closer cop''s boot.<br/> <br/>The picture does indeed look almost surreal.<br/> <br/>Please write some info so we can read the interesting story here.<br/> <br/>The moral of the story: don''t run and don''t fight back?</td>', 'After the challenge. Well, I liked it before and I still like it. Oddly, the thing that really makes me like it is the sharpness at the bottom of the closer cop''s boot. The picture does indeed look almost surreal. Please write some info so we can read the interesting story here. The moral of the story: don''t run and don''t fight back?', '2006-01-04 12:28:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2002846, 271651, 28710, '<td valign="top">I think the weirdest thing about this pic is the tree on the roof. Strange place for a tree.<br/> <br/>Alternate title suggestion: Just a little to the right...</td>', 'I think the weirdest thing about this pic is the tree on the roof. Strange place for a tree. Alternate title suggestion: Just a little to the right...', '2006-01-04 12:31:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2002883, 272985, 28710, '<td valign="top">I like the use of CAT in the picture ;)<br/> <br/>Don''t worry about getting your picture ripped off - the picture is only 640x480. Nobody can sell that big of a picture.<br/> <br/>So don''t worry about putting your name in the pic, your name will only be unknown for the week of voting.<br/> <br/>Keep trying!</td>', 'I like the use of CAT in the picture ;) Don''t worry about getting your picture ripped off - the picture is only 640x480. Nobody can sell that big of a picture. So don''t worry about putting your name in the pic, your name will only be unknown for the week of voting. Keep trying!', '2006-01-04 12:41:45.000000', NULL, 0),
