(2008770, 272877, 5885, '<td valign="top">I think it''s funny how DrAchoo thought this shot was from me ;-) Well, it does seem like a shot I''d take, but well ya beat me to it. Good work on this one. It''s hard to score high around here though with open shows of sexuality. BUT, look how many good comments ya got ;-)<br/> <br/>Don''t get discouraged, keep ''em coming.<br/> <br/>BTW, this shot may have gained a few more points if you had used only the refrigerator light for lighting, shooting with your camera on a tripod at a long shutter speed. This would have definitely made it seem more like the girl had popped out of the refrigerator.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-05 23:56:27.</i></td>', 'I think it''s funny how DrAchoo thought this shot was from me ;-) Well, it does seem like a shot I''d take, but well ya beat me to it. Good work on this one. It''s hard to score high around here though with open shows of sexuality. BUT, look how many good comments ya got ;-) Don''t get discouraged, keep ''em coming. BTW, this shot may have gained a few more points if you had used only the refrigerator light for lighting, shooting with your camera on a tripod at a long shutter speed. This would have definitely made it seem more like the girl had popped out of the refrigerator.', '2006-01-05 23:53:01.000000', '2006-01-05 23:56:27.000000', 0),
